  ('p','**Can one person use the REX ONE?**'),
  ('p','Yes. The REX ONE is designed for rapid deployment by a single responder, and the balanced wheels and telescoping pull handle let one person move the patient.'),
  ('p','**Can the REX ONE go down the stairs?**'),
  ('p','For stairs and steep ground, choose the REX DCS. It is the REX ONE with a Descent Control System hand brake for controlled descent down stairwells and steep terrain.'),
